Subject: [PATCH] Refine portfolio for a professional presentation

- Content: tighten EN/PT copy, translate remaining English titles in the
  PT version, use consistent project categories, drop the motivational
  quote section and the unverifiable response-time promise
- Remove decorative effects (crosshair, click sparks, WebGL glow cursor)
  and the continuously animating noise overlay
- Compile Tailwind CSS instead of the CDN play script; pin Lucide to
  1.77.0; update renamed icons (house, code-xml)
- SEO: correct title, Open Graph/Twitter image, JSON-LD Person data,
  remove hreflang links to an unsupported ?lang parameter; add favicon
- Remove unused files (root data.js, sessions/quote.*)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
